nd Gary Stewart are dispatched, along with Amy Crystal and Harry Harris, to investigate and evacuate the populace. They suddenly encounter the impish Zeal, who had recently dealt with G. Upon finding G alive but wounded, James and Gary converse with him and G gives them a field journal showing the bosses and weak points. The pair are then met with a massive undead horde, similar to the kind from the Curien Mansion incident. They continue on, trying to save the town's civilians from the zombies.", "summary": "The House of the Dead 2 is a first-person light gun shooter arcade game with a horror theme and the second game in The House of the Dead series of video games. The direct sequel to The House of the Dead, it was developed by Sega for arcades on the Sega NAOMI board in November 1998 then later ported to the Dreamcast in 1999 and Microsoft Windows in 2001, and is also found on the Xbox as an unlockable bonus in The House of the Dead III. The game appears in the compilation The House of the Dead 2 & 3 Return for Wii. The Dreamcast version became a Sega All Stars title.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-house-of-the-dead-2", "videos": [{"id": 6286, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "TiO3SkjiFW0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TiO3SkjiFW0", "title": "House of the Dead 2 - Game Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TiO3SkjiFW0/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 36623, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "O2alnNLQFEg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O2alnNLQFEg", "title": "The House Of The Dead 2 - Full Playthrough (HD)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/O2alnNLQFEg/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 45607, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "M_KQbA3nMTo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_KQbA3nMTo", "title": "The House of the Dead 2 (1998) PC", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M_KQbA3nMTo/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 489, "name": "The House of The Dead"}]}